MESH_STR_ENTRY(ABOUT_WORKING_CHECK,       "checking...")
/* The same row once the download has a size to divide by. Just the figure: the bar beside it
   carries the shape, and the row above it already says which step is running - so repeating
   "downloading" here would clip the one thing this row adds. A whole percent, because
   tenths on a number that moves every second are noise. */
